OL,3,ABessent urges US partners to back plans
OL,4,Ato 'squash' Iran economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent
OL,7,Furged US allies to "make a decision" on
OL,8,Fwhether they will support Washington's
OL,9,Fefforts to "squash" the Iranian
OL,10,Feconomy.
OL,12,FBessent's remarks come after US
OL,13,FPresident Donald Trump said on his
OL,14,Fsocial platform Truth Social that
OL,15,Fcountries providing "any type of
OL,16,Flifeline" to the Islamic Republic's
OL,17,Fregime will face "tremendous economic
OL,18,Fconsequences".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
